g skills with Hyper mode, a series of test in different circuit, the best score and time will be published in the online leaderboard!<br></li><li> Split screen multiplayer! Yeah, back we're in 2000! you can now beat your friends in 1 screen with the split screen multiplayer mode!</li></ul>",
